**Displacement**

\[
s = u\,t + \tfrac12 a t^{2}
   = 5\,\text{m/s}\times 10\,\text{s}
     + \tfrac12(2\,\text{m/s}^2)(10\,\text{s})^{2}
   = 50 + 100
   = 150 \text{ m}
\]

**Final speed**

\[
v = u + a t
   = 5\,\text{m/s} + 2\,\text{m/s}^2 \times 10\,\text{s}
   = 5 + 20
   = 25 \text{ m/s}
\]

Rounded to two decimal places:

- **Displacement:** **150.00 m**  
- **Final speed:** **25.00 m/s**
